l for getting help. It contains no games, saves, passwords or Wi-Fi keys and is saved in the diagnostics folder.", "Repair Settings", "Check complete", "The operation failed", "Reset User Profile", "Profile reset", "Factory Reset", "Full Factory Reset", "Finds and fixes damaged settings files. Games and saves are not touched.", "Resets the current user's preferences, controls and app settings. Saves are kept. The console restarts.", "Erases users, settings, Wi-Fi networks and Bluetooth pairings, then starts the initial setup. Games and BIOS are kept.", "Like Factory Reset, and also erases every user's saves, states, screenshots and app data. Games and BIOS are kept.", "Press again to confirm • the console restarts", "Press once more to also erase all saves", "Safe Mode", "The interface closed unexpectedly several times. nuubOS started with the default theme so you can fix the problem.", "Restart Normally", "Output Folder", "Game Details", "Details", "Game Settings", "Emulator", "Aspect Ratio", "Video Filter", "Default ({0})", "As the game", "Full Screen", "Integer Scaling", "Sharp", "Smooth", "Pixel Perfect", "Reset Game Settings", "Changes apply the next time the game starts", "Collections", "New Collection", "Collection name", "Hide Game", "Hidden Games", "No hidden games", "Only for you; the game stays available to other users", "Delete Game", "Permanently deletes the game file for every user. Saves are kept.", "Press again to delete permanently", "Game deleted", "The game could not be deleted", "Reset Play Statistics", "Sessions", "Last Played", "Time Played", "Developer", "Publisher", "Release Date", "Genre", "Players", "File", "Get Metadata", "Update Metadata", "Check this match", "Accept Match", "Reject Match", "Game Metadata", "ScreenScraper Account", "Not signed in", "Sign Out", "Get Metadata for All Games", "Uses the Internet only when you ask. Games without metadata keep their file name.", "The metadata service is not available", "Getting metadata", "Meta