s version was restored", "Update installed", "Downloading update", "Online Services", "nuubOS works fully offline. These services use the network only when you enable or start them.", "Only when you check", "Not in use", "Media", "Server address (http://server:8096)", "The media could not be played", "The server could not be reached", "Syncthing", "Keeps your saves in sync with your other devices. It is not a backup.", "This Console's ID", "Add it on your other device; it then appears here to accept", "Saves", "Save States", "Screenshots", "Wants to connect • press to accept", "Syncthing stopped unexpectedly", "Web", "Enter Address", "Web address or search", "Bookmarks", "History", "No bookmarks yet", "Add Bookmark", "Bookmark added", "Clear History", "Clear Browsing Data", "Removes cookies, site sign-ins and cached pages of this profile. Bookmarks are kept.", "The browser could not be started", "The browser closed unexpectedly", "WEB", "Go Back", "Go Forward", "Reload", "Zoom", "Quit Web", "Done", "D-pad moves between links, the left stick moves the pointer and the right stick scrolls.", "Keyboard", "Select a text field first", "Close the browser first", "Gaming", "GAMING", "LIBRARY", "Connect with WPS", "Cancel WPS", "Press the WPS button on your router…", "WPS timed out. Press the router button and try again.", "Several routers are in WPS mode. Try again in a few minutes.", "WPS failed: {0}", "WPS connection failed", "Leaves safe mode and restarts with your theme and settings.", "Connect to Wi-Fi or turn on Remote Services to get help remotely. Back returns here.", "Nothing played yet", "Your adventure log is a blank page. Pick a game and write chapter one!", "Fresh save file", "No games played so far. The controller is warmed up and ready.", "Player 1, ready?", "Your recently played games will appear here. Go make some history!", "Zero high scores… for now", "Start any game and it will be waiting right here for you.", "This shelf is gathering dust", "Insert coin… or better, some games", "The arcade is quiet. Too quiet.", "Nothing to launch yet", "Applications you add will appear here.", "SERVICES", "DISPLAY", "AUDIO", "SOUNDS", "POWER", "STORAGE & SOFTWARE", "TROUBLESHOOTING", "CONTROLLERS", "RUMBLE & LIGHTING", "Saved Backups", "Backup deleted", "The backup could not be deleted", "Network name (SSID)", "Press together to exit", "Lights up only for system signals", "One steady color", "Slowly fades in and out", "A comet of light circles the stick", "Soft shades drift around the ring", "Every color, slowly turning", "Charge left at a glance, pulses while charging", "The color of the system you are playing", "Mood Color", "Cyan", "Mint", "Lime", "Amber", "Orange", "Red", "Pink", "Violet", "White", "Custom", "YOUR SYSTEMS", "OTHER SYSTEMS", "Start Game", "Continue", "Start from the Beginning", "Automatic Save", "Saved {0}", "Console Boot Screens", "Shows the console's start-up logo when its BIOS is available", "Save State Slots", "Rotate Save Slots", "Each save goes to the next slot, then starts again from slot 0", "Game Hotkeys", "Hold Hotkey and press a button", "Performance Overlay", "Bezels", "Frames the game when it does not fill the screen", "CRT Effect", "Scanlines for consoles played on TVs", "Next Slot", "Previous Slot", "Fast Forward", "Show Overlay", "Frame Rate", "Temperature", "Power Draw", "Battery", "Clock", "Empty", "{0}%", "The metadata service is busy, try again later", "Uppercase", "Metadata Source", "Covers, screenshots, descriptions and ratings in your language. A free ScreenScraper account gives more requests.", "Covers, screenshots and descriptions in English. A free private API key gives more requests.", "Covers and screenshots only. No account needed.", "TheGamesDB API Key", "Not set", "Fill Missing Data", "Adds only what is missing, such as covers or descriptions. What is already there is kept.", "Search Name", "Searched as \"{0}\". Change it if the game is not found or the match is wrong.", "Source: {0}", "Optional: more requests per day", "Scan for New Games", "Finds games copied to the SD card since the last scan", "New games found: {0}", "No new games found", "BACKGROUND TASK", "Stop", "Stopping…", "Starting game…", "Muted", "Power", "BATTERY", "ACCESSORY BATTERIES", "Charge", "Battery Health", "Discharging", "Not charging", "Good", "Overheating", "Too cold", "Worn out", "Check the battery", "No accessories connected", "ENERGY SAVING", "Find a Game", "Find", "Random Game", "Random Unplayed Game", "Title", "Decade", "Any", "Never Played Only", "Show Results ({0})", "No games match these filters", "Results", "Add to Collection", "Delete Collection", "Systems", "SURPRISE ME", "SEARCH", "Rename Collection", "Clear Filters", "Picks one of your games for you", "Added to {0}", "Removed from {0}", "Collection deleted", "Manage", "Games stay in your library; only the collection goes away", "Notification Sounds", "Automatic Updates", "Restore Version {0}", "The new version did not start", "Version {0} restored", "New versions install when you open Steam Link; one that does not start is undone automatically", "VIDEO", "PC", "Audio Channels", "Stereo", "5.1 Surround", "7.1 Surround", "Play Audio on the PC", "Optimize Game Settings", "Lets the PC adapt the game to the stream resolution", "Quit the App on the PC After Streaming", "Left and right change it", "Metadata in Your Language", "Gets descriptions and genres in your language; the languages already downloaded stay saved", "Every game with missing data", "Not tried in the last hour", "Not tried in the last day", "Not tried in the last week", "Not tried in the last month", "January", "February", "March", "April", "May", "June", "July", "August", "September", "October", "November", "December", "Monday", "Tuesday", "Wednesday", "Thursday", "Friday", "Saturday", "Sunday", "Day", "Month", "Year", "Hour", "Minute"];
    in-out property <int> selected-index: 0;
    in-out property <bool> brightness-visible: false;
    in-out property <bool> switch-user-visible: false;
    in-out property <bool> home-music-playing: false;
    in-out property <int> brightness-value: 60;
    in-out property <float> brightness-fraction: 0.6;
    in-out property <string> brightness-label: "60%";
    in-out property <int> battery-percent: -1;
    in-out property <string> battery-state: "unknown";
    in-out property <string> battery-label: "--%";
    /* Effective profile is Battery Saver: the glyph takes the warning colour
     * (same as Home's top bar). */
    in-out property <bool> battery-saver: false;
    in-out property <string> clock-label: "";
    in-out property <string> performance-profile-label: root.i18n-strings[52];

    in-out property <bool> menu-panel-visible: true;
    in-out property <string> audio-output-label: root.i18n-strings[210];
    in-out property <bool> audio-volume-visible: true;
    in-out property <string> audio-volume-label: "100%";
    in-out property <float> audio-volume-fraction: 1.0;
    in-out property <string> system-sounds-label: "60%";
    in-out property <float> system-sounds-fraction: 0.6;
    in-out property <bool> audio-output-dropdown-open: false;
    in-out property <int> audio-output-dropdown-index: 0;
    in-out property <int> audio-output-dropdown-scroll: 0;
    in-out property <int> audio-output-dropdown-visible-rows:
        root.height <= 480px ? 4 : 5;
    in-out property <[string]> audio-output-options: [];
    in-out property <bool> volume-osd-visible: false;
    in-out property <bool> volume-osd-supported: true;
    in-out property <string> volume-osd-title: root.i18n-strings[240];
    in-out property <string> volume-osd-detail: "100%";
    in-out property <float> volume-osd-fraction: 1.0;

    /* Global notifications. */
    in-out property <bool> toast-visible: false;
    in-out property <int> toast-icon: 0;
    in-out property <int> toast-severity: 0;
    in-out property <string> toast-title: "";
    in-out property <string> toast-detail: "";
    in-out property <int> toast-battery: -1;
    in-out property <float> toast-progress: -1;
    out property <duration> toast-scroll-time: toast-card.scroll-time;
    out property <length> toast-marquee-offset: toast-card.marquee-offset;

    /*
     * Which layer surface this window is rendered into:
     * 0 full-screen (Quick Menu, lifecycle), 1 volume OSD surface only,
     * 2 Web Mode keyboard (bottom sheet surface only).
     */
    in-out property <int> surface-mode: 0;

    /* Running game (nuubos-emud): its actions come first (CLAUDE §18.1).
     * game-confirm-index is the row waiting for its second press (also
     * 1 Restart and 2 Power Off in SYSTEM). */
    in-out property <bool> game-section-visible: false;
    in-out property <string> game-slot-label: "";
    /* State Slot (row 11) opens a dropdown of every slot with its save
     * time (or Empty); confirm selects it. */
    in-out property <bool> game-slot-dropdown-open: false;
    in-out property <int> game-slot-dropdown-index: 0;
    in-out property <int> game-slot-dropdown-scroll: 0;
    in-out property <[string]> game-slot-options: [];
    /* Performance overlay of the running game's user (row 28, switch). */
    in-out property <bool> game-overlay-on: false;
    in-out property <int> game-confirm-index: -1;
    /* STREAM: a PC stream runs (nuubos-streamd, EPIC-025). Rows 15 Resume,
     * 16 Quit Stream, 17 Quit and Close Application (second press, through
     * game-confirm-index), then read-only statistics sampled when the menu
     * opens. Never visible together with GAME. */
    in-out property <bool> stream-section-visible: false;
    /* The session is Steam Link (EPIC-026): Resume and Quit Steam Link
     * only; Valve's application has no statistics or host application. */
    in-out property <bool> stream-steamlink: false;
    in-out property <string> stream-latency-label: "";
    /* WEB: the Web Mode browser runs (nuubos-webd, EPIC-030). Rows 20
     * Resume, 27 Keyboard, 21 Go Back, 22 Go Forward, 23 Reload, 24 Zoom
     * (left/right, confirm restores), 25 Add Bookmark, 26 Quit Web. */
    in-out property <bool> web-section-visible: false;
    in-out property <string> web-zoom-label: "100%";
    /* A text field of the page has the focus (input method active). */
    in-out property <bool> web-ime-active: false;
    /* Web Mode keyboard sheet (surface-mode 2): four rows of up to ten
     * keys, focus kb-index = row * 10 + column; kb-preview is the text of
     * the focused field when the page reports it. */
    in-out property <[string]> kb-row-zero: [];
    in-out property <[string]> kb-row-one: [];
    in-out property <[string]> kb-row-two: [];
    in-out property <[string]> kb-row-three: [];
    in-out property <int> kb-index: 0;
    in-out property <string> kb-preview: "";
    in-out property <string> kb-mode-label: "";
    in-out property <bool> kb-visible: false;
    in-out property <string> stream-decode-label: "";
    in-out property <string> stream-video-label: "";

    /* BACKGROUND TASK: the oldest running job that may be cancelled (its
     * Live Notification carries cancel=1). Row 29 = title (+ progress) and
     * Stop, second press through game-confirm-index. */
    /* CONTROLLERS: Player Assignment (row 30), shown while an external
     * controller is connected. Its dropdown first lists the players, then
     * the controllers for the chosen player (players-dropdown-title). */
    in-out property <bool> players-visible: false;
    in-out property <string> players-label: "";
    in-out property <[string]> players-options: [];
    in-out property <bool> players-dropdown-open: false;
    in-out property <int> players-dropdown-index: 0;
    in-out property <int> players-dropdown-scroll: 0;
    in-out property <string> players-dropdown-title: "";
    in-out property <bool> context-section-visible: false;
    in-out property <string> context-section-title: root.i18n-strings[808];
    in-out property <string> context-primary-label: "";
    in-out property <string> context-primary-value: "";

    /*
     * Physical face positions, never Xbox/Nintendo letters:
     * 0 top, 1 right, 2 bottom, 3 left, -1 unavailable.
     */
    in-out property <int> confirm-face-position: -1;
    in-out property <int> back-face-position: -1;

    in-out property <bool> lifecycle-active: false;
    /* Power OSD (power key, every context): Sleep on top, Restart and
     * Power Off side by side below; Restart/Power Off need a second press
     * (power-osd-confirm). The side sheet is hidden while it is open. */
    in-out property <bool> power-osd-open: false;
    in-out property <int> power-osd-index: 0;
    in-out property <bool> power-osd-confirm: false;
    in-out property <string> lifecycle-mode: "";
    in-out property <float> line-progress: 1.0;
    in-out property <float> curtain-progress: 1.0;
    in-out property <image> splash-image;
    in-out property <float> splash-split: 0.485;
    in-out property <float> splash-line-fraction: 0.483;
    in-out property <length> splash-line-height: 3px;

    /* Quick Menu grid. Same visual grammar as Settings (row colors, section
     * headers, metrics); geometry is derived from the configured surface
     * size and owned here, so Rust never duplicates pixel positions. */
    property <length> panel-width:
        root.width < 900px ? max(300px, root.width * 0.54) : 400px;
    property <length> row-height: max(42px, min(56px, root.height * 0.0875));
    property <length> slider-row-height: root.row-height + 20px;
    property <length> row-gap: 8px;
    property <length> section-header: 26px;
    property <length> section-gap: 10px;
    property <length> header-height: 60px;
    property <length> footer-height: 58px;
    property <length> content-top: root.header-height + 12px;

    property <length> game-y: root.content-top;
    property <length> game-row0-y: root.game-y + root.section-header;
    property <length> game-step: root.row-height + root.row-gap;
    /* GAME has nine rows (ten with Player Assignment below State Slot,
     * game-extra shifts the rows after it), WEB eight. */
    property <int> game-extra: root.game-section-visible && root.players-visible ? 1 : 0;
    property <length> game-end: root.game-row0-y + (root.game-section-visible ? 8 + root.game-extra : 7) * root.game-step + root.row-height;
    property <length> stream-end: root.game-row0-y + (root.stream-steamlink ? 1 : 5) * root.game-step + root.row-height;
    property <length> context-y: root.game-section-visible ? root.game-end + root.section-gap
        : root.stream-section-visible ? root.stream-end + root.section-gap
        : root.web-section-visible ? root.game-end + root.section-gap
        : root.content-top;
    property <length> display-y: root.context-section-visible
        ? root.context-y + root.section-header + root.row-height + root.section-gap
        : root.context-y;
    property <length> audio-row-y: root.display-y + root.section-header;
    property <length> brightness-row-y: root.audio-row-y + root.slider-row-height + root.row-gap;
    property <length> skip-row-y: root.brightness-visible
        ? root.brightness-row-y + root.slider-row-height + root.row-gap
        : root.brightness-row-y;
    property <length> display-end: root.home-music-playing
        ? root.skip-row-y + root.row-height
        : root.skip-row-y - root.row-gap;
    property <length> user-y: root.display-end + root.section-gap;
    property <length> user-row-y: root.user-y + root.section-header;
    property <length> players-row-y: root.game-row0-y + 4 * root.game-step;
    property <length> system-y: root.switch-user-visible
        ? root.user-row-y + root.row-height + root.section-gap
        : root.user-y;
    property <length> perf-row-y: root.system-y + root.section-header;
    property <length> sleep-row-y: root.perf-row-y + root.row-height + root.row-gap;
    property <length> restart-row-y: root.sleep-row-y + root.row-height + root.row-gap;
    property <length> poweroff-row-y: root.restart-row-y + root.row-height + root.row-gap;

    property <length> focus-top:
        /* 18 Screenshot and 28 Performance Overlay sit before 14 Quit Game. */
        root.selected-index == 29 ? root.context-y + root.section-header
        : root.selected-index == 30 ? root.players-row-y
        : root.selected-index == 18 ? root.game-row0-y + (6 + root.game-extra) * root.game-step
        : root.selected-index == 28 ? root.game-row0-y + (7 + root.game-extra) * root.game-step
        : root.selected-index == 14 ? root.game-row0-y + (8 + root.game-extra) * root.game-step
        /* WEB: 20 Resume, 27 Keyboard, then 21..26 in order. */
        : root.selected-index == 20 ? root.game-row0-y
        : root.selected-index == 27 ? root.game-row0-y + root.game-step
        : root.selected-index >= 21 ? root.game-row0-y + (root.selected-index - 19) * root.game-step
        : root.selected-index >= 15 ? root.game-row0-y + (root.selected-index - 15) * root.game-step
        : root.selected-index >= 12 ? root.game-row0-y + (root.selected-index - 8 + root.game-extra) * root.game-step
        : root.selected-index >= 8 ? root.game-row0-y + (root.selected-index - 8) * root.game-step
        : root.selected-index == 3 ? root.audio-row-y
        : root.selected-index == 5 ? root.brightness-row-y
        : root.selected-index == 7 ? root.skip-row-y
        : root.selected-index == 6 ? root.user-row-y
        : root.selected-index == 4 ? root.perf-row-y
        : root.selected-index == 0 ? root.sleep-row-y
        : root.selected-index == 1 ? root.restart-row-y
        : root.poweroff-row-y;
    property <length> focus-bottom: root.focus-top
        + (root.selected-index == 3 || root.selected-index == 5 ? root.slider-row-height : root.row-height);
    property <length> viewport-top: root.header-height + 6px;
    property <length> viewport-bottom: root.height - root.footer-height - 8px;
    /* Keep the focused row inside the viewport; section header of the first
     * section stays visible when scrolled to the top. */
    property <length> scroll: min(
        max(0px, root.focus-bottom - root.viewport-bottom),
        max(0px, root.focus-top - root.viewport-top
            - (root.focus-top == root.audio-row-y || root.selected-index == 8 || root.selected-index == 15
                || root.selected-index == 20 || root.selected-index == 29
                ? root.section-header : 0px)));

    property <bool> selected-adjustable:
        (root.selected-index == 3 && root.audio-volume-visible)
        || (root.selected-index == 24 && root.web-section-visible)
        || (root.selected-index == 5 && root.brightness-visible);

    title: root.i18n-strings[232];
    background: #00000000;
    default-font-family: "Cantarell";

    Rectangle {
        x: 0;
        y: 0;
        width: parent.width;
        height: parent.height;
        background: #0000007a;
        visible: root.menu-panel-visible;
    }

    Rectangle {
        x: 0;
        y: 0;
        width: root.panel-width;
        height: parent.height;
        /* M3 modal side sheet: large shape on the free edge, no divider. */
        background: Theme.background;
        border-top-right-radius: Shape.large;
        border-bottom-right-radius: Shape.large;
        visible: root.menu-panel-visible;
        clip: true;

        /* GAME: actions of the running game, first in the menu. */
        QmSectionHeader {
            x: 16px; y: root.game-y - root.scroll; width: parent.width - 32px;
            label: root.i18n-strings[415];
            visible: root.game-section-visible;
        }
        QmRow {
            x: 16px; y: root.game-row0-y - root.scroll;
            width: parent.width - 32px; height: root.row-height;
            title: root.i18n-strings[416];
            selected: root.selected-index == 8;
            visible: root.game-section-visible;
        }
        QmRow {
            x: 16px; y: root.game-row0-y + root.game-step - root.scroll;
            width: parent.width - 32px; height: root.row-height;
            title: root.i18n-strings[417];
            value: root.game-slot-label;
            selected: root.selected-index == 9;
            visible: root.game-section-visible;
        }
        QmRow {
            x: 16px; y: root.game-row0-y + 2 * root.game-step - root.scroll;
            width: parent.width - 32px; height: root.row-height;
            title: root.i18n-strings[418];
            value: root.game-slot-label;
            armed: root.game-confirm-index == 10;
            prompt: root.i18n-strings[191];
            selected: root.selected-index == 10;
            visible: root.game-section-visible;
        }
        QmRow {
            x: 16px; y: root.game-row0-y + 3 * root.game-step - root.scroll;
            width: parent.width - 32px; height: root.row-height;
            title: root.i18n-strings[419];
            value: root.game-slot-label;
            selected: root.selected-index == 11;
            visible: root.game-section-visible;
        }
        QmRow {
            x: 16px; y: root.players-row-y - root.scroll;
            width: parent.width - 32px; height: root.row-height;
            title: root.i18n-strings[13];
            value: root.players-label;
            selected: root.selected-index == 30;
            visible: root.game-section-visible && root.players-visible;
        }
        QmRow {
            x: 16px; y: root.game-row0-y + (4 + root.game-extra) * root.game-step - root.scroll;
            width: parent.width - 32px; height: root.row-height;
            title: root.i18n-strings[420];
            armed: root.game-confirm-index == 12;
            prompt: root.i18n-strings[191];
            selected: root.selected-index == 12;
            visible: root.game-section-visible;
        }
        QmRow {
            x: 16px; y: root.game-row0-y + (5 + root.game-extra) * root.game-step - root.scroll;
            width: parent.width - 32px; height: root.row-height;
            title: root.i18n-strings[421];
            selected: root.selected-index == 13;
            visible: root.game-section-visible;
        }
        QmRow {
            x: 16px; y: root.game-row0-y + (6 + root.game-extra) * root.game-step - root.scroll;
            width: parent.width - 32px; height: root.row-height;
            title: root.i18n-strings[592];
            selected: root.selected-index == 18;
            visible: root.game-section-visible;
        }
        QmRow {
            x: 16px; y: root.game-row0-y + (7 + root.game-extra) * root.game-step - root.scroll;
            width: parent.width - 32px; height: root.row-height;
            title: root.i18n-strings[774];
            toggle: true;
            toggle-on: root.game-overlay-on;
            selected: root.selected-index == 28;
            visible: root.game-section-visible;
        }
        QmRow {
            x: 16px; y: root.game-row0-y + (8 + root.game-extra) * root.game-step - root.scroll;
            width: parent.width - 32px; height: root.row-height;
            title: root.i18n-strings[422];
            armed: root.game-confirm-index == 14;
            prompt: root.i18n-strings[191];
            selected: root.selected-index == 14;
            visible: root.game-section-visible;
        }

        /* STREAM: the running PC stream, first in the menu. */
        QmSectionHeader {
            x: 16px; y: root.game-y - root.scroll; width: parent.width - 32px;
            label: root.stream-steamlink ? root.i18n-strings[478] : root.i18n-strings[468];
            visible: root.stream-section-visible;
        }
        QmRow {
            x: 16px; y: root.game-row0-y - root.scroll;
            width: parent.width - 32px; height: root.row-height;
            title: root.i18n-strings[416];
            selected: root.selected-index == 15;
            visible: root.stream-section-visible;
        }
        QmRow {
            x: 16px; y: root.game-row0-y + root.game-step - root.scroll;
            width: parent.width - 32px; height: root.row-height;
            title: root.stream-steamlink ? root.i18n-strings[496] : root.i18n-strings[469];
            selected: root.selected-index == 16;
            visible: root.stream-section-visible;
        }
        QmRow {
            x: 16px; y: root.game-row0-y + 2 * root.game-step - root.scroll;
            width: parent.width - 32px; height: root.row-height;
            title: root.i18n-strings[470];
            armed: root.game-confirm-index == 17;
            prompt: root.i18n-strings[191];
            selected: root.selected-index == 17;
            visible: root.stream-section-visible && !root.stream-steamlink;
        }
        for stat[k] in [
            { title: root.i18n-strings[471], value: root.stream-latency-label },
            { title: root.i18n-strings[472], value: root.stream-decode-label },
            { title: root.i18n-strings[473], value: root.stream-video-label },
        ]: QmRow {
            x: 16px; y: root.game-row0-y + (3 + k) * root.game-step - root.scroll;
            width: parent.width - 32px; height: root.row-height;
            title: stat.title;
            value: stat.value;
            visible: root.stream-section-visible && !root.stream-steamlink;
        }

        /* WEB: the running browser, first in the menu. */
        QmSectionHeader {
            x: 16px; y: root.game-y - root.scroll; width: parent.width - 32px;
            label: root.i18n-strings[691];
            visible: root.web-section-visible;
        }
        for web[k] in [
            { index: 20, title: root.i18n-strings[416], value: "" },
            { index: 27, title: root.i18n-strings[699], value: root.web-ime-active ? "" : root.i18n-strings[700] },
            { index: 21, title: root.i18n-strings[692], value: "" },
            { index: 22, title: root.i18n-strings[693], value: "" },
            { index: 23, title: root.i18n-strings[694], value: "" },
            { index: 24, title: root.i18n-strings[695], value: root.web-zoom-label },
            { index: 25, title: root.i18n-strings[684], value: "" },
            { index: 26, title: root.i18n-strings[696], value: "" },
        ]: QmRow {
            x: 16px; y: root.game-row0-y + k * root.game-step - root.scroll;
            width: parent.width - 32px; height: root.row-height;
            title: web.title;
            value: web.value;
            selected: root.selected-index == web.index;
            visible: root.web-section-visible;
        }

        /* BACKGROUND TASK: Stop for a running cancellable job. */
        QmSectionHeader {
            x: 16px; y: root.context-y - root.scroll; width: parent.width - 32px;
            label: root.context-section-title;
            visible: root.context-section-visible;
        }
        QmRow {
            x: 16px; y: root.context-y + root.section-header - root.scroll;
            width: parent.width - 32px; height: root.row-height;
            title: root.context-primary-label;
            value: root.context-primary-value;
            armed: root.game-confirm-index == 29;
            prompt: root.i18n-strings[191];
            selected: root.selected-index == 29;
            visible: root.context-section-visible;
        }

        QmSectionHeader {
            x: 16px; y: root.display-y - root.scroll; width: parent.width - 32px;
            label: root.i18n-strings[234];
        }
        QmSliderRow {
            x: 16px; y: root.audio-row-y - root.scroll;
            width: parent.width - 32px; height: root.slider-row-height;
            title: root.i18n-strings[235];
            value: root.audio-output-label;
            fraction: root.audio-volume-fraction;
            show-slider: root.audio-volume-visible;
            selected: root.selected-index == 3;
        }
        QmSliderRow {
            x: 16px; y: root.brightness-row-y - root.scroll;
            width: parent.width - 32px; height: root.slider-row-height;
            title: root.i18n-strings[127];
            value: root.brightness-label;
            fraction: root.brightness-fraction;
            selected: root.selected-index == 5;
            visible: root.brightness-visible;
        }
        QmRow {
            x: 16px; y: root.skip-row-y - root.scroll;
            width: parent.width - 32px; height: root.row-height;
            title: root.i18n-strings[329];
            icon: @image-url("assets/icons/forward-step.svg");
            show-icon: true;
            selected: root.selected-index == 7;
            visible: root.home-music-playing;
        }

        /* User/session actions are separated from device/system policy. */
        QmSectionHeader {
            x: 16px; y: root.user-y - root.scroll; width: parent.width - 32px;
            label: root.i18n-strings[312];
            visible: root.switch-user-visible;
        }
        QmRow {
            x: 16px; y: root.user-row-y - root.scroll;
            width: parent.width - 32px; height: root.row-height;
            title: root.i18n-strings[292];
            selected: root.selected-index == 6;
            visible: root.switch-user-visible;
        }

        QmSectionHeader {
            x: 16px; y: root.system-y - root.scroll; width: parent.width - 32px;
            label: root.i18n-strings[49];
        }
        QmRow {
            x: 16px; y: root.perf-row-y - root.scroll;
            width: parent.width - 32px; height: root.row-height;
            title: root.i18n-strings[236];
            value: root.performance-profile-label;
            selected: root.selected-index == 4;
        }
        QmRow {
            x: 16px; y: root.sleep-row-y - root.scroll;
            width: parent.width - 32px; height: root.row-height;
            title: root.i18n-strings[189];
            selected: root.selected-index == 0;
        }
        QmRow {
            x: 16px; y: root.restart-row-y - root.scroll;
            width: parent.width - 32px; height: root.row-height;
            title: root.i18n-strings[237];
            armed: root.game-confirm-index == 1;
            prompt: root.i18n-strings[191];
            selected: root.selected-index == 1;
        }
        QmRow {
            x: 16px; y: root.poweroff-row-y - root.scroll;
            width: parent.width - 32px; height: root.row-height;
            title: root.i18n-strings[58];
            armed: root.game-confirm-index == 2;
            prompt: root.i18n-strings[191];
            selected: root.selected-index == 2;
        }

        /* Fixed header masks content while controller focus scrolls. */
        Rectangle {
            x: 0;
            y: 0;
            width: parent.width;
            height: root.header-height;
            background: Theme.background;
            z: 80;

            /* Title "Menu", the clock centred, then the battery (Home's top
             * bar grammar). */
            MarqueeText {
                x: 20px; y: 11px; width: parent.width / 2 - 70px; height: 32px;
                label: root.i18n-strings[187]; text-color: Theme.text; text-size: 25px; text-weight: 700;
            }

            Text {
                x: (parent.width - 120px) / 2; y: 11px; width: 120px; height: 32px;
                horizontal-alignment: center;
                vertical-alignment: center;
                text: root.clock-label;
                color: Theme.text;
                font-size: 20px;
                font-weight: 600;
            }

            BatteryGlyph {
                x: parent.width - 96px;
                y: 15px;
                percent: root.battery-percent;
                charging: root.battery-state == "charging";
                battery-saver: root.battery-saver;
            }

            /* Wide enough for "100%" (it was cut at 40 px). */
            Text {
                x: parent.width - 62px;
                y: 15px;
                width: 48px;
                height: 24px;
                horizontal-alignment: right;
                vertical-alignment: center;
                text: root.battery-label;
                color: #e5e7eb;
                font-size: 18px;
                font-weight: 700;
            }

            Rectangle {
                x: 20px;
                y: parent.height - 1px;
                width: parent.width - 40px;
                height: 1px;
                background: Theme.surface;
            }
        }

        /* Universal context-sensitive action bar. Hint pairs flow by their
         * real text width so localized labels never collide. */
        Rectangle {
            z: 80;
            x: 0;
            y: parent.height - root.footer-height;
            width: parent.width;
            height: root.footer-height;
            background: Theme.background;
            clip: true;

            Rectangle {
                x: 16px;
                y: 0;
                width: parent.width - 32px;
                height: 1px;
                background: Theme.surface;
            }

            HorizontalLayout {
                x: 16px;
                y: 0;
                width: parent.width - 32px;
                height: parent.height;
                spacing: 8px;
                alignment: start;

                if !root.selected-adjustable: VerticalLayout {
                    alignment: center;
                    FaceButtonHint { active-position: root.confirm-face-position; }
                }
                if root.selected-adjustable: VerticalLayout {
                    alignment: center;
                    HorizontalAdjustHint { }
                }
                Text {
                    vertical-alignment: center;
                    text: root.selected-adjustable ? root.i18n-strings[238] : root.i18n-strings[185];
                    color: #b8bdc5; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600;
                }
                Rectangle { width: 6px; }
                VerticalLayout {
                    alignment: center;
                    FaceButtonHint { active-position: root.back-face-position; }
                }
                Text {
                    vertical-alignment: center;
                    text: root.i18n-strings[186];
                    color: Theme.text-secondary; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600;
                }
                Rectangle { width: 6px; }
                VerticalLayout {
                    alignment: center;
                    MenuActionHint { }
                }
                Text {
                    vertical-alignment: center;
                    text: root.i18n-strings[239];
                    color: Theme.text-dim; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600;
                    overflow: elide;
                    horizontal-stretch: 1;
                }
            }
        }
    }

    /* Dropdowns open below their row, or above it when the screen ends
     * first (a row near the bottom, e.g. Audio over a game). */
    property <length> audio-dd-height: 12px + min(root.audio-output-options.length, root.audio-output-dropdown-visible-rows) * (root.row-height + root.row-gap) - root.row-gap;
    property <length> audio-dd-below: root.audio-row-y + root.slider-row-height + 4px - root.scroll;
    property <length> slot-row-y: root.game-row0-y + 3 * root.game-step - root.scroll;
    property <length> slot-dd-height: 12px + min(root.game-slot-options.length, root.audio-output-dropdown-visible-rows) * (root.row-height + root.row-gap) - root.row-gap;

    /* Audio output dropdown, anchored to the Audio row. */
    Rectangle {
        x: 16px;
        y: root.audio-dd-below + root.audio-dd-height > root.height - 8px
            ? max(8px, root.audio-row-y - root.scroll - 4px - root.audio-dd-height)
            : root.audio-dd-below;
        width: root.panel-width - 32px;
        height: root.audio-dd-height;
        background: Theme.surface-container-high;
        border-radius: Shape.large;
        clip: true;
        visible: root.menu-panel-visible && root.audio-output-dropdown-open;
        z: 70;

        for option[i] in root.audio-output-options: QmRow {
            x: 6px;
            y: 6px + (i - root.audio-output-dropdown-scroll) * (root.row-height + root.row-gap);
            width: parent.width - 12px;
            height: root.row-height;
            title: option;
            selected: root.audio-output-dropdown-index == i;
            visible: i >= root.audio-output-dropdown-scroll
                && i < root.audio-output-dropdown-scroll + root.audio-output-dropdown-visible-rows;
        }
    }

    /* Player Assignment dropdown, anchored to its row: a title line (the
     * level: all players, or one player's controllers), then the options. */
    property <length> players-dd-height: 12px + 30px + min(root.players-options.length, root.audio-output-dropdown-visible-rows) * (root.row-height + root.row-gap) - root.row-gap;
    property <length> players-dd-below: root.players-row-y - root.scroll + root.row-height + 4px;
    Rectangle {
        x: 16px;
        y: root.players-dd-below + root.players-dd-height > root.height - 8px
            ? max(8px, root.players-row-y - root.scroll - 4px - root.players-dd-height)
            : root.players-dd-below;
        width: root.panel-width - 32px;
        height: root.players-dd-height;
        background: Theme.surface-container-high;
        border-radius: Shape.large;
        clip: true;
        visible: root.menu-panel-visible && root.players-dropdown-open;
        z: 70;

        MarqueeText {
            x: 16px; y: 8px; width: parent.width - 32px; height: 26px;
            label: root.players-dropdown-title;
            text-color: Theme.text-dim;
            text-size: 13px;
            text-weight: 600;
            active: true;
        }
        for option[i] in root.players-options: QmRow {
            x: 6px;
            y: 36px + (i - root.players-dropdown-scroll) * (root.row-height + root.row-gap);
            width: parent.width - 12px;
            height: root.row-height;
            title: option;
            selected: root.players-dropdown-index == i;
            visible: i >= root.players-dropdown-scroll
                && i < root.players-dropdown-scroll + root.audio-output-dropdown-visible-rows;
        }
    }

    /* State Slot dropdown, anchored to the State Slot row. */
    Rectangle {
        x: 16px;
        y: root.slot-row-y + root.row-height + 4px + root.slot-dd-height > root.height - 8px
            ? max(8px, root.slot-row-y - 4px - root.slot-dd-height)
            : root.slot-row-y + root.row-height + 4px;
        width: root.panel-width - 32px;
        height: root.slot-dd-height;
        background: Theme.surface-container-high;
        border-radius: Shape.large;
        clip: true;
        visible: root.menu-panel-visible && root.game-slot-dropdown-open;
        z: 70;

        for option[i] in root.game-slot-options: QmRow {
            x: 6px;
            y: 6px + (i - root.game-slot-dropdown-scroll) * (root.row-height + root.row-gap);
            width: parent.width - 12px;
            height: root.row-height;
            title: option;
            selected: root.game-slot-dropdown-index == i;
            visible: i >= root.game-slot-dropdown-scroll
                && i < root.game-slot-dropdown-scroll + root.audio-output-dropdown-visible-rows;
        }
    }

    /* System-wide volume OSD. The same layer-shell surface is used without
     * controller capture when Quick Menu itself is closed. */
    /* OSD-only mode uses a surface sized to the card itself. */
    property <bool> osd-compact: root.surface-mode == 1;
    Rectangle {
        x: (parent.width - 360px) / 2;
        y: root.osd-compact ? (parent.height - self.height) / 2 : parent.height - 142px;
        width: 360px;
        height: 82px;
        background: Theme.surface-container-high;
        border-radius: Shape.large;
        visible: root.volume-osd-visible && root.surface-mode != 2;
        z: 80;

        MarqueeText {
            x: 18px; y: 12px; width: parent.width - 36px; height: 25px;
            label: root.volume-osd-title;
            text-color: Theme.text;
            text-size: 20px;
            text-weight: 600;
            
        }

        MarqueeText {
            x: 18px; y: 42px; width: parent.width - 36px; height: 22px;
            label: root.volume-osd-detail;
            text-color: root.volume-osd-supported ? Theme.text-secondary : #d4d7dc;
            text-size: root.volume-osd-supported ? 15px : 14px;
            text-weight: 600;
            visible: !root.volume-osd-supported;
            
        }

        MaterialSlider {
            x: 18px; y: 48px; width: parent.width - 36px;
            fraction: root.volume-osd-fraction;
            visible: root.volume-osd-supported;
        }

        Text {
            x: parent.width - 68px; y: 11px; width: 50px; height: 25px;
            text: root.volume-osd-supported ? root.volume-osd-detail : "";
            color: Theme.text;
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 700;
            horizontal-alignment: right;
        }
    }


    /* Web Mode keyboard: the whole surface-mode 2 surface, a bottom sheet
     * over the page. Keys commit straight into the focused field. */
    Rectangle {
        x: 0;
        y: 0;
        width: parent.width;
        height: parent.height;
        background: Theme.surface-container-low;
        visible: root.surface-mode == 2;

        property <length> pad: 18px;
        property <length> key-gap: 5px;
        property <length> footer: 30px;
        property <length> field-height: 72px;
        property <length> key-height: (self.height - 12px - self.field-height - 10px - self.footer - 6px - 3 * self.key-gap) / 4;

        QmTextEntryField {
            x: parent.pad; y: 12px;
            width: parent.width - 2 * parent.pad;
            title: root.i18n-strings[678];
            /* The end of the field (where typing happens) stays visible. */
            Text {
                x: min(12px, parent.width - 12px - self.preferred-width);
                y: 0; height: 38px;
                width: self.preferred-width;
                text: root.kb-preview;
                color: Theme.text;
                font-size: 17px;
                vertical-alignment: center;
            }
        }
        for keys[r] in [root.kb-row-zero, root.kb-row-one, root.kb-row-two, root.kb-row-three]: HorizontalLayout {
            x: parent.pad;
            y: 12px + parent.field-height + 10px + r * (parent.key-height + parent.key-gap);
            width: parent.width - 2 * parent.pad;
            height: parent.key-height;
            spacing: parent.key-gap;
            for key[i] in keys: QmKey {
                label: key;
                selected: root.kb-index == r * 10 + i;
            }
        }
        HorizontalLayout {
            x: parent.pad;
            y: parent.height - parent.footer - 2px;
            width: parent.width - 2 * parent.pad;
            height: parent.footer;
            spacing: 8px;
            alignment: start;
            VerticalLayout {
                alignment: center;
                FaceButtonHint { active-position: root.confirm-face-position; }
            }
            Text {
                vertical-alignment: center;
                text: root.i18n-strings[185];
                color: Theme.text-secondary; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;
            }
            Rectangle { width: 6px; }
            VerticalLayout {
                alignment: center;
                FaceButtonHint { active-position: root.back-face-position; }
            }
            Text {
                vertical-alignment: center;
                text: root.i18n-strings[697];
                color: Theme.text-secondary; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;
            }
            Rectangle { horizontal-stretch: 1; }
            Text {
                vertical-alignment: center;
                text: root.kb-mode-label;
                color: Theme.text-faint; font-size: 12px;
            }
        }
    }

    /*
     * Copy of the notification card drawn inside the open Quick Menu, at
     * exactly the position of the persistent notification surface
     * (NotificationWindow, anchored top-right with the same 14 px offset).
     * Opening or closing the menu therefore never changes the card's pixels,
     * whichever surface ends up on top.
     */
    toast-card := NotificationCard {
        x: root.width - 14px - self.width;
        y: 14px;
        width: 400px;
        icon: root.toast-icon;
        severity: root.toast-severity;
        title: root.toast-title;
        detail: root.toast-detail;
        battery: root.toast-battery;
        progress: root.toast-progress;
        visible: root.toast-visible && root.menu-panel-visible && !root.lifecycle-active;
        z: 90;
    }

    /* Power OSD: compact nuubOS console styling. The UI only presents
     * lifecycle actions; nuubos-systemd owns their behavior. */
    Rectangle {
        x: 0; y: 0; width: parent.width; height: parent.height;
        background: #000000d4;
        visible: root.power-osd-open && root.surface-mode == 0 && !root.lifecycle-active;
        z: 85;

        Rectangle {
            width: min(parent.width - 56px, 500px);
            height: 256px;
            x: (parent.width - self.width) / 2;
            y: (parent.height - self.height) / 2;
            /* M3 dialog: tonal surface, extra-large shape, tonal buttons
             * with the focus indicator on the selected one. */
            background: Theme.surface-container-high;
            border-radius: Shape.extra-large;

            Text {
                x: 0px; y: 18px;
                width: parent.width; height: 30px;
                text: root.i18n-strings[188];
                color: Theme.text-secondary;
                font-size: 15px;
                font-weight: 600;
                horizontal-alignment: center;
                vertical-alignment: center;
            }

            Rectangle {
                x: 24px; y: 64px;
                width: parent.width - 48px; height: 92px;
                background: root.power-osd-index == 0 ? Theme.secondary-container : Theme.surface-container-highest;
                border-radius: Shape.extra-large;
                border-width: root.power-osd-index == 0 ? 3px : 0px;
                border-color: Theme.primary;

                Text {
                    x: 18px; y: 0; width: parent.width - 36px; height: parent.height;
                    text: root.i18n-strings[189];
                    color: Theme.text;
                    font-size: 25px;
                    font-weight: 600;
                    horizontal-alignment: center;
                    vertical-alignment: center;
                }
            }

            PowerChoice {
                x: 24px; y: 172px;
                width: (parent.width - 56px) / 2; height: 60px;
                label: root.i18n-strings[190];
                prompt: root.i18n-strings[191];
                selected: root.power-osd-index == 1;
                armed: root.power-osd-index == 1 && root.power-osd-confirm;
            }

            PowerChoice {
                x: 32px + (parent.width - 56px) / 2; y: 172px;
                width: (parent.width - 56px) / 2; height: 60px;
                label: root.i18n-strings[58];
                prompt: root.i18n-strings[191];
                selected: root.power-osd-index == 2;
                armed: root.power-osd-index == 2 && root.power-osd-confirm;
            }
        }
    }

    /*
     * Lifecycle animation. The splash image is rendered by Rust (src/splash.rs)
     * at the exact physical surface size, identical to the kernel/compositor
     * frames, and drawn 1:1. Existing qualified P0.1 lifecycle animation, kept above fullscreen
     * clients by the Quick Menu's layer-shell Overlay surface.
     */
    Rectangle {
        x: 0;
        y: -(parent.height * root.splash-split) * root.curtain-progress;
        width: parent.width;
        height: parent.height * root.splash-split;
        clip: true;
        visible: root.lifecycle-active;

        Image {
            x: 0;
            y: 0;
            width: root.width;
            height: root.height;
            source: root.splash-image;
            image-fit: fill;
        }
    }

    Rectangle {
        x: 0;
        y: parent.height * root.splash-split
            + (parent.height * (1 - root.splash-split)) * root.curtain-progress;
        width: parent.width;
        height: parent.height * (1 - root.splash-split);
        clip: true;
        visible: root.lifecycle-active;

        Image {
            x: 0;
            y: -(root.height * root.splash-split);
            width: root.width;
            height: root.height;
            source: root.splash-image;
            image-fit: fill;
        }
    }

    Rectangle {
        x: (parent.width - self.width) / 2;
        y: parent.height * root.splash-split
            - (parent.height * root.splash-split) * root.curtain-progress;
        width: parent.width * (root.splash-line-fraction + (1 - root.splash-line-fraction) * root.line-progress);
        height: root.splash-line-height;
        background: Theme.accent-muted;
        visible: root.lifecycle-active;
    }

    Rectangle {
        x: (parent.width - self.width) / 2;
        y: parent.height * root.splash-split
            + (parent.height * (1 - root.splash-split)) * root.curtain-progress
            - self.height;
        width: parent.width * (root.splash-line-fraction + (1 - root.splash-line-fraction) * root.line-progress);
        height: root.splash-line-height;
        background: Theme.accent-muted;
        visible: root.lifecycle-active;
    }

    Rectangle {
        x: (parent.width - self.width) / 2;
        y: parent.height * root.splash-split
            - (parent.height * root.splash-split) * root.curtain-progress
            - 2px;
        width: parent.width * (root.splash-line-fraction + (1 - root.splash-line-fraction) * root.line-progress);
        height: 7px;
        background: Theme.accent-muted;
        opacity: 0.06;
        visible: root.lifecycle-active;
    }

    Rectangle {
        x: (parent.width - self.width) / 2;
        y: parent.height * root.splash-split
            + (parent.height * (1 - root.splash-split)) * root.curtain-progress
            - 5px;
        width: parent.width * (root.splash-line-fraction + (1 - root.splash-line-fraction) * root.line-progress);
        height: 7px;
        background: Theme.accent-muted;
        opacity: 0.06;
        visible: root.lifecycle-active;
    }
}

/*
 * Global notification surface: a passive top-right layer surface of its own
 * (416x88 logical: the 400x72 card plus an 8 px inset), independent of the
 * Quick Menu so opening/closing the menu never remaps it.
 */
export component NotificationWindow inherits Window {
    in-out property <int> toast-icon: 0;
    in-out property <int> toast-severity: 0;
    in-out property <string> toast-title: "";
    in-out property <string> toast-detail: "";
    in-out property <int> toast-battery: -1;
    in-out property <float> toast-progress: -1;
    out property <duration> toast-scroll-time: toast-card.scroll-time;
    out property <length> toast-marquee-offset: toast-card.marquee-offset;

    title: "nuubOS Notification";
    background: #00000000;
    default-font-family: "Cantarell";

    toast-card := NotificationCard {
        x: 8px;
        y: 8px;
        width: root.width - 16px;
        icon: root.toast-icon;
        severity: root.toast-severity;
        title: root.toast-title;
        detail: root.toast-detail;
        battery: root.toast-battery;
        progress: root.toast-progress;
    }
}
